# QCF per-page mushaf fonts are now TRACKED (~850 KB for pages 1-10 + basmala).
#
# They used to be ignored as "re-downloadable from the jsDelivr CDN mirror",
# but the build copies fonts/ into dist/ and then into the APK, so a clean
# clone (and every CI build) produced an app with no local fonts at all — the
# mushaf reader silently fell back to the CDN on every page turn, meaning no
# offline mushaf and an undisclosed third-party request. A reproducible build
# is worth far more than 850 KB.
#
# Licensing: see fonts/qcf/README.md and fonts/qcf/LICENSE for the King Fahd
# Complex terms before redistributing these.

# local test screenshot
mushaf-page*.png
